# Mage tower: while an enemy unit is in its range, free workers come by road, take a staff and stand on the walkways
# (or on the road) nearest to the demons, each turning a small cone of light on a demon (StructureSystem::tickCarriers,
# the guard states with Walker::mage). No light, no stores. A 4x4 m footprint (2x2 cells), spawned origin 2.0 above
# the ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants, boxes and a ball only): a stone plinth (the root),
# a stone drum, a slim blue tower on it, a stepped dark roof of three slabs and a pale crystal ball on top. The child
# pieces are render-only.
